    <string name="vd_enable_smart">Enable smart video detection</string>
    <string name="vd_off_desc">When off, Vigil taps on a fixed interval the whole time the engine is running - it will not check whether a video is playing.</string>
    <string name="vd_detection_method">Detection method</string>
    <string name="vd_detection_method_desc">Audio is usually far more reliable than watching the screen - most videos play sound. Visual can still help for muted videos.</string>
    <string name="vd_detection_point">Detection point</string>
    <string name="vd_detection_point_desc">A separate cyan point marking where to watch for video motion - place it over the actual video (e.g. screen center), independent of where the tap point is.</string>
